world is {width: 128, height: 128}
player is {x: 60, y: 60, image: "hero", speed: 2, facing: "down"}
jumps is 0
when "space" is pressed
  add 1 to jumps
to update
  move player with arrows
to draw
  write "x {player.x} y {player.y} f {player.facing} w {player.walking} j {jumps}" at 2, 2 in white on hud
run game with update and draw
